// ---- the witnesses: the map's houses -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// A unit is what stands on one tile (a bed; a table with its chairs, which share the table's tile...), its category
// the categories of its things ("bed", "seat+table"...): counts, clearances and doorways go by category.
// The things that only stand near another (HOUSE_DEPENDS: cues by a pool table...) are left out of the units: they
// come with what they go with (HOUSE_SATELLITES). A unit with a thing that only stands on a hearth (the fire) is
// counted apart ("hearth"), among the houses that have a hearth. What the map has outdoors only (trees, bushes, shop
